WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.550
- This is the thing. This show isn't live.

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.980
That's a whole different situation,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.813
when you're doing live stuff.

00:00:03.813 --> 00:00:06.100
Like when I host award shows,
it's a different animal.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.740
So out of The Today Show all those years,

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.060
like what was your most
favorite unplanned moment?

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.840
- Well, I have a lot of 'em, you know,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.540
but I did the show for 15 years, I think.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.630
Well, one time a woman exposed
herself when she was out

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:22.110
on the Plaza and the rest of the anchors.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.060
- Did you throw her beads?

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.560
- No, bu I was on a remote location

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.070
and the rest of the anchors,
she was behind them,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.810
so they didn't see anything.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.683
So basically you saw me in the box going.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.463
So that was great.

00:00:36.463 --> 00:00:37.296
I mean, there'd been a lot.

00:00:37.296 --> 00:00:39.500
And then I was interviewing Barbara Bush

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.480
at the White House for the
anniversary of the White House.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.720
And we were getting a whole
tour and suddenly her husband,

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.980
President George Herbert Walker Bush,

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.050
walked in with their dog.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.870
And I had to do an impromptu
19 minute interview

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:54.480
that I hadn't prepared for.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.303
- I bet those 19 minutes lasted forever.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.700
- Oh my god. I was so fitted
out and it was so stressful.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.610
And I kept thinking, I'm
gonna run outta questions.

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:04.727
I'm gonna start asking him

00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:06.770
"What's your favorite food
here in the white house?".

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:07.603
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:01:07.603 --> 00:01:08.940
- You know, but it all worked out.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:09.980
- Oh, that's so cool though.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:11.850
That's a really cool
impromptu kind of interview.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:12.683
- Yeah.

00:01:12.683 --> 00:01:13.873
- Nobody gets that chance often.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:15.673
- I knows it was funny.

00:01:15.673 --> 00:01:16.940
I can't believe that he decided to walk in

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.290
in the middle of our
interview, but he did.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.456
And it was great.

00:01:20.456 --> 00:01:21.289
- [Kelly] I love that.

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:22.910
- That was when I had first
started on The Today Show.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.097
- [Kelly] Oh my God!

00:01:24.097 --> 00:01:25.276
- So it was a big moment for me yeah.

00:01:25.276 --> 00:01:26.648
- [Kelly] Like "welcome" (laughs).

